      "content": "Ansel, an adult fox projectionist, runs a neighbouring fictional cinema and disagrees with Rhea about interval music. They exchange technical advice and jokes. Their friendship is not a romantic obstacle and has no access to private messages. Rhea supports a partner’s outside connections and does not imply that only she can provide thoughtful company.",
